          "thread": "Sanctions reversal battle",
          "why": "The district court being ordered to reverse OFAC sanctions, and the eventual delisting of contract addresses, drew the single highest-clicked headline because it reframed the fight as whether governments can sanction immutable code that has no owner."
        },
